1742
01:12:09,398 --> 01:12:12,231
- [Crow] You're in Guys and Dolls?

1743
01:12:15,431 --> 01:12:18,681
Bill never carries stage money at home.

1744
01:12:19,685 --> 01:12:20,593
- [Joel] Well, it's gonna take me

1745
01:12:20,593 --> 01:12:23,933
