- [Joel] Ladies and
gentlemen, Merritt Stone.

1748
01:12:29,372 --> 01:12:32,220
- [Tom] He's not Merritt Stone.

1749
01:12:32,220 --> 01:12:34,517
- I wired ahead to the police.

1750
01:12:34,517 --> 01:12:36,646
They'll meet the train
in Newark in the morning.

1751
01:12:36,646 --> 01:12:38,129
- Sound idea.

1752
01:12:38,129 --> 01:12:39,718
- [Joel] Father Dowling Mysteries.

1753
01:12:39,718 --> 01:12:41,200
- One more thing,

1754
01:12:41,200 --> 01:12:42,731
- [Crow] You know, I've
always wanted to be a priest,

1755
01:12:42,731 --> 01:12:44,491
